<title>BELGIUM: Belgacom pension fund seeks asset manager.</title>
<headline>Belgacom pension fund seeks asset manager.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The  Belgacom Pension Fund, Belgium's largest pension fund, said in a statement on Friday it tendered for a new manager for assets worth around eight billion Belgian francs in line with European Union law on public procurement.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available to confirm if this would be in addition to the 65 billion francs of assets the fund has already placed with eight other fund managers.</p>
<p>The notice to tender was published in the EU's Official Journal on March 18. The deadline for applications is April 16.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
